	(text "CANFD Tranciever:\n2 Options that I found which maximize input impedance at a low cost:\nTCAN1044 and TCAN1462 (both V variants).\nThey are both 5V input, adjustible output (via VIO), and have high input diff impedance (min 40kOhm) which gives the best chance at this device working with many nodes.\nTCAN1462 has Signal Improvement Capability.\n\nOne thing, If there is a single bus, and a device faults the bus, that takes out the entire network. It could be better designed with multiple busses?"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.942 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3e35b971-88ed-4b4f-94e3-55d9fdc029fb")
	)
	(text "Decoupling for pin 61/60"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
